### Project-level bus factor: 2
If Graham Campbell and Aiko Tanaka both left, about 87% of the surviving lines in `src/Parser` would have no knowledgeable maintainer. Authors are counted from `git blame -w -M -C` on HEAD, so they are the people whose lines still exist.

