| "Your Name" (`<email redacted>`) | 69 | 4% | 2026-08-26 |
| Vance Lucas | 10 | <1% | not in the commit log; inherited by blame |
| Jonas Staudenmeir, JT Smith, StyleCI Bot | 1 each | <1% | 2024-07, 2022-10, 2026-08 |

- **Active status:** The newest commit in the repo is 2026-08-26, which is 57 days ago. Both main authors are inside the 90-day window.
- **Identity merging:** There is no `.mailmap`. Graham appears under 3 emails and Aiko under 2 spellings. I merged them by name.
- **Anonymous authors:** `root` and "Your Name" are placeholder identities. I can't tell who they are from git alone.

